  "explanation": "The pipeline starts with a Builder to draft the core strategy, then an Analyst adds cross-cultural insights on trust and procurement behavior. A Refiner fuses these into a culturally intelligent draft, which is evaluated by a Critic quality gate; if it fails, it loops back to the Refiner for improvement. Once passed, a domain Expert validates legal and technical accuracy, a second Refiner integrates those corrections, and a Polisher produces the final executive-ready document. This design ensures cultural nuance, compliance rigor, and strategic coherence while remaining under eight steps."
